{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07521","headline":"春望寄王涔阳 · 刘长卿","name":"春望寄王涔阳","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"清明别後雨晴时，极浦空颦一望眉。\n湖畔春山烟点点，云中远树墨离离。\n依微水戍闻钲鼓，掩映沙村见酒旗。\n风煖草长愁自醉，行吟无处寄相思。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘长卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07521.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07521","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}